Booking add-ons — factor these in

<%= @booking.user.first_name %> requested extra service(s) for this visit. These are
NOT separate bookings — the same technician does them back-to-back with the main
service. Please allow for the extra time and add the charge on the day.

Booking:      #<%= @booking.id %>
Main service: <%= @booking.service.name %>
Technician:   <%= @technician_name %>
When:         <%= @booking.starts_at&.in_time_zone(BusinessHours.zone)&.strftime("%b %-d, %Y at %-l:%M %p %Z") %>

Add-ons:
<% @addons.each do |a| -%>
  - <%= a[:name] %> (<%= a[:duration] %> min) — $<%= a[:price] %>
<% end -%>
Add-ons total: $<%= @total %>

The add-on total is already folded into the customer's charge for this visit.
